Hello,

I'd like to announce tpm2-tools 4.0-RC2 is available:
https://github.com/tpm2-software/tpm2-tools/releases/tag/4.0-rc2

It contains 3 forward facing changes since RC1:
- Fix parsing bug in PCR mini-language.
- Fix misspelling of TPM2_PT_HR constants which effects tpm2_getcap output.
- configure option --with-bashcompdir for specifying bash completion
  directory.

